What is the time complexity of the following nested loop structure?

```
for i from 1 to n:
  for j from 1 to n:
    for k from 1 to n:
      // constant time operation
```

What is the space complexity of the following recursive function?

```
function recurse(n):
  if n <= 1:
    return 1
  else:
    return recurse(n-1) + recurse(n-1)
```
